content.strength_and_weaknesses:
*Strength:*

The idea proposed by this paper is pretty novel and effective; 

This paper is well written and easy to understand;

This paper provides a new benchmark to test physic related reasoning tasks;

This paper has completed comparisons with current reasoning enhanced techniques, such as Chain of Thought, “Let’s think step by step” with zero-shot priming, Self-consistency decoding. 

*Weaknesses:*

I hope this method could be open sourced, which will promote the development of the whole community.

